                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='41667' id='102' type-v2='text' w='50563' x='48938' y='16667'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#4e79a7' fontname='Tableau Semibold' fontsize='8'>Key insights:</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='1'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Volkswagen is a top revenue generator in the sector</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: With €254B in revenue, Volkswagen ranks second only to Toyota and accounts for about 10% of total sector revenue, closely matching the industry leader.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='3'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Profit margins lag sector leaders but remain stable</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: Volkswagen&apos;s profitability sits at 3.98%, slightly above the sector average (around 1.05%), but below top performers like Toyota, highlighting efficient operations yet room for improvement.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='3'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Sector context: large, competitive, but low average profitability</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: The motor vehicles &amp; parts sector is enormous (€2.487B revenue), with generally low profitability, implying challenging industry dynamics, but Volkswagen manages above-average performance.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='3'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Volkswagen&apos;s workforce is the largest in the sector</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: With over 662,575 employees, Volkswagen leads the sector in total workforce, signaling large-scale operations and a significant global footprint.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='3'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Volatility in Stock Price</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>: Volkswagen&apos;s stock peaked post-2020 but has declined steadily since, reflecting market uncertainties despite solid financial fundamentals, a trend also reflected in moderating sector profitability.</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='3'>Æ </run>
                    <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Volkswagen is a sector heavyweight with strong revenue, above-average profitability, and the largest workforce. It matches industry leaders but could improve margins and long-term market perception. The sector overall is robust but faces profitability challenges.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
